{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"预层范畴之间的伴随"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"预层范畴之间的伴随"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>预层范畴之间的伴随是"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}},{"Plain":"中十分常见的一种现象, 指的是范畴 $\\mathcal C$, $\\mathcal D$ 之间的函子诱导的"},{"Local":{"url":"预层","text":"预层范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\widehat {\\mathcal C} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}),\\widehat {\\mathcal D} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})$ 之间的伴随.</p>\n<p>当然, "},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实范畴"}},{"Plain":"中也有相应的现象.</p>\n<p>预层范畴之间的伴随是是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Kan扩张","text":"Kan 扩张"}},{"Plain":"的特例, 而数学中的许多现象又是它的特例.</p>\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>函子 $f\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal D$ 诱导"},{"Local":{"url":"预层","text":"预层范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\widehat {\\mathcal C} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}),\\widehat {\\mathcal D} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})$ 之间的伴随\n$$\r\nf_! \\dashv f^* \\dashv f_*,\r\n$$\n其中</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$f^*\\colon \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}) \\to \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})$ 是预层的拉回 (函子的复合),\n$$\r\n  (f^* X)(c) = X(f(c)).\r\n$$</li>\n<li>拉回的左伴随 $f_!$ 是沿 $f$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"Kan扩张","text":"左 Kan 扩张"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\n  (f_! X)(d) = \\operatorname{colim}_{d\\to f(c)} X(c).\r\n$$</li>\n<li>拉回的右伴随 $f_*$ 是沿 $f$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"Kan扩张","text":"右 Kan 扩张"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\n  (f_* X)(d) = \\operatorname{lim}_{f(c)\\to d} X(c).\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>代函子</h3>\n<p>左 Kan 扩张可视为"},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":"的复合, 右 Kan 扩张可视为"},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":"的同态集.</p>\n<p>若将 $f\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ 视为 $\\mathcal C$ 到 $\\mathcal D$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\widetilde f\\colon \\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to\\mathsf{Set},\\,\r\n(c,d)\\mapsto\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(d,f(c)),\r\n$$\n将 $F\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ 视为 $1$ 到 $\\mathcal C$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":", 那么两者的复合为\n$F\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}\\widetilde f \\colon \\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$,\n$$\r\nd\\mapsto\\operatorname{colim}_{c}\r\nF(c)\\times\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(d,f(c)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>若将 $f\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ 视为 $\\mathcal D$ 到 $\\mathcal C$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\bar f\\colon \\mathcal D\\times\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{Set},\\,\r\n(d,c)\\mapsto \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(f(c),d),\r\n$$\n将 $F\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ 视为 $1$ 到 $\\mathcal C$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":", 那么 $\\widetilde f$ 到 $F$ 的同态集为 $1$ 到 $\\mathcal D$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":" $[\\bar f,F]\\colon \\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{Set}$,\n$$\r\nd\\mapsto \\operatorname{lim}_{c}\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Set}}\r\n\\big({\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(f(c),d)},F(c)\\big).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>伴随诱导预层范畴之间的伴随</h3>\n<p>设 $f\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal D$, $g\\colon \\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ 是一对"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":", $f\\dashv g$.\n注意到\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Psh} = \\operatorname{Hom}((-)^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})\\colon \\mathsf{Cat}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}\r\n$$\n是 $2$-范畴之间的函子, 它保持"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":"; 即 $f^*\\colon \\widehat {\\mathcal D} \\to \\widehat {\\mathcal C}$, $g^*\\colon \\widehat {\\mathcal C} \\to \\widehat {\\mathcal D}$ 也是一对伴随, $f^* \\dashv g^*$.\n换言之,\n$$\r\nf^* = g_!,\\quad f_* = g^*.\r\n$$\n这两个等价也可使用 $g_!$, $f_*$ 的具体表达式验证:\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n(g_! X) (c) &amp;= \\operatorname{colim}_{c\\to g(d)} X(d) \\\\\r\n&amp;= \\operatorname{colim}_{f(c)\\to d} X(d)\\\\\r\n&amp;= X(f(c)) = (f^*X) (c),\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n(f_* X) (d) &amp;= \\operatorname{lim}_{f(c)\\to d} X(c) \\\\\r\n&amp;= \\operatorname{colim}_{c\\to g(d)} X(c)\\\\\r\n&amp;= X(g(d)) = (g^*X) (d).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>总结起来, 对于伴随 $f\\dashv g$, 有预层范畴之间的四元伴随\n$$\r\nf_! \\dashv (f^*=g_!) \\dashv (f_*=g^*) \\dashv g_*.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>对可表函子的作用</h3>\n<p>设函子 $f\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal D$ 诱导"},{"Local":{"url":"预层","text":"预层范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\widehat {\\mathcal C} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}),\\widehat {\\mathcal D} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})$ 之间的伴随\n$$\r\nf_! \\dashv f^* \\dashv f_*,\r\n$$\n则对于 $c\\in \\mathcal C$, 有 $f_! \\mathbf{y}(c) = \\mathbf{y}(f(c))$.</p>\n<h3>先推再拉</h3>\n<p>当 $f\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"全忠实函子","text":"全忠实函子"}},{"Plain":", 即全子范畴的嵌入时,\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\nf^*f_! X (c) &amp;=\r\nf_! X(f(c))\\\\\r\n&amp;=\r\n\\operatorname{colim}_{f(c) \\to f(c')} X(c')\\\\\r\n&amp;=\r\n\\operatorname{colim}_{c \\to c'} X(c') = X(c),\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\nf^*f_* X (c) &amp;=\r\nf_* X(f(c))\\\\\r\n&amp;=\r\n\\operatorname{lim}_{f(c') \\to f(c)} X(c')\\\\\r\n&amp;=\r\n\\operatorname{lim}_{c' \\to c} X(c') = X(c),\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n即两个自然映射 $f^*f_*\\to X \\to f^*f_! X$ 均为同构.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n"}]}}